      "instance_name": "islamophobic_stereotype",
      "label": "Islamophobic Stereotype: Muslims as rapists",
      "description": "This stereotype falsely and dangerously associates all Muslims with sexual violence, particularly rape. It is a core component of Islamophobic hate speech and is used to dehumanize and demonize Muslims. The meme explicitly invokes this stereotype in its text, making it essential background knowledge to understand the hateful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
