      "instance_name": "hate_speech_context",
      "label": "Hate Speech Context",
      "description": "The meme is an example of hate speech targeting Muslims. Understanding that this is hate speech requires knowledge of social and political discourse, where such messages are used to incite prejudice, fear, and hostility toward a specific group. The overall intent is to spread hatred, which is a key background knowledge element.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
