      "description": "The target community is individuals who hold or are susceptible to Islamophobic beliefs, particularly those who may be influenced by or spread harmful stereotypes about Muslims, such as associating them with sexual violence or 'uncivilized' behavior. The meme is designed to appeal to or reinforce prejudice against Muslims by leveraging a dehumanizing visual metaphor (scavenging goats) and a false safety claim ('the muslims won't rape you now'), which are potent tools in hate speech targeting this group.",
